      "text": [
        "641 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «مَنْ قَبِلَ اَللَّهُ مِنْهُ صَلاَةً وَاحِدَةً لَمْ يُعَذِّبْهُ وَ مَنْ قَبِلَ اَللَّهُ لَهُ حَسَنَةً لَمْ يُعَذِّبْهُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.641 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"Whoever has one prayer accepted by Allah (swt) will not be punished, and whoever has one good deed accepted by Allah (swt) will not be punished.\""
        ]
      }
